1
00:01:04,458 --> 00:01:07,583
SUNDAN ANG X

2
00:01:29,041 --> 00:01:31,958
TATLONG BUWAN BAGO ANG LAHAT

3
00:01:51,083 --> 00:01:52,666
Good morning, Your Grace.

4
00:01:54,750 --> 00:01:57,000
- Geoffrey.
- Ang ganda ng tanawin, 'no?

5
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,165
Baka oras na ho
para bumalik ka sa bahay, sir?

6
00:02:01,166 --> 00:02:04,124
Pababa na ho ang mga bisita
para mag-almusal.

7
00:02:04,125 --> 00:02:07,833
Gusto ko sanang simulan
ang shoot team talk ng 9:30.

8
00:02:09,208 --> 00:02:13,291
Four hundred years ago,
abot hanggang tanaw ang estate na 'to.

9
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:16,333
<i>Kahit saan ka tumingin.
Hanggang sa baybayin.</i>

10
00:02:17,791 --> 00:02:19,291
<i>Unti-unti 'tong lumiit.</i>

11
00:02:20,041 --> 00:02:24,124
<i>Taon-taon. Sa bawat henerasyon.</i>

12
00:02:24,125 --> 00:02:26,125
Una, ang mga paghingi ng tawad.

13
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:28,333
Sumunod ang hiya.

14
00:02:30,333 --> 00:02:31,875
Pagkatapos, ang pagliit.

15
00:02:33,750 --> 00:02:34,875
Parang bulok na kumalat.

16
00:02:37,833 --> 00:02:39,375
Gusto ko 'tong mabawi, Geoff.

17
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:44,750
Gusto kong mabawi lahat.

18
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:52,375
ANG DAAN SA KAPANGYARIHAN

19
00:02:54,250 --> 00:02:56,415
Binili natin 'tong airfield na 'to?

20
00:02:56,416 --> 00:02:58,250
Hindi tayo. Ang Lordship.

21
00:02:58,833 --> 00:03:00,208
Gamit ang shell company.

22
00:03:00,708 --> 00:03:04,124
100,000 square foot ng weed farm,
nakatago sa ilalim ng hangar.

23
00:03:04,125 --> 00:03:06,499
<i>Tamang-tama para sa distribution.</i>

24
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:08,832
<i>Sa ilalim ng hangar itatanim.
Doon din ikakarga.</i>

25
00:03:08,833 --> 00:03:12,249
<i>Tapos puwede nang i‑distribute
kahit saan sa bansa, by land or by air.</i>

26
00:03:12,250 --> 00:03:14,790
Tapos may air shows,
restaurant, at gift shop.

27
00:03:14,791 --> 00:03:16,916
Magagandang paraan para maglinis ng pera.

28
00:03:17,708 --> 00:03:19,457
Espresso martini, sir?

29
00:03:19,458 --> 00:03:21,540
Maaga silang nagsisimula kapag shoot day.

30
00:03:21,541 --> 00:03:23,416
Kung gano'n, when in Rome…

31
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:25,958
Madam?

32
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:29,708
Alam mo?

33
00:03:30,458 --> 00:03:32,957
Mukhang tama si Papa tungkol sa Duke.

34
00:03:32,958 --> 00:03:35,915
Magandang idea 'yon.
Gawin sa Italy ang ginagawa natin dito.

35
00:03:35,916 --> 00:03:39,207
<i>Magpatubo ng sarili nating produkto
sa mga palazzo ng mga aristokrata.</i>

36
00:03:39,208 --> 00:03:40,415
O, eto na pala siya.

37
00:03:40,416 --> 00:03:43,499
Ang Italian contact natin,
ang daan natin papasok sa Europe.

38
00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:46,499
Pinasok natin ang international market
at nagbubunga na 'yon.

39
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:47,957
Para saan 'yong Spitfires?

40
00:03:47,958 --> 00:03:50,625
Hindi mo masasabi kung kailan
magsisimula ang giyera, Jack.

41
00:03:57,208 --> 00:04:00,041
{\an8}Ilabas n'yo 'ko
sa eroplanong 'to, punyeta!

42
00:04:01,416 --> 00:04:04,290
{\an8}Sa susunod, 'yong totoong piloto
ang kunin natin, ha?

43
00:04:04,291 --> 00:04:05,832
{\an8}Sa susunod, maglakad ka na lang.

44
00:04:05,833 --> 00:04:08,583
{\an8}Tigilan mo 'ko. Nasusuka 'ko.

45
00:04:09,916 --> 00:04:11,916
Good morning, Mr. Maldini.

46
00:04:12,458 --> 00:04:13,333
{\an8}<i>Buongiorno.</i>

47
00:04:13,875 --> 00:04:15,374
{\an8}Ako na d'yan.

48
00:04:15,375 --> 00:04:16,874
{\an8}BAGONG ITALIAN BUSINESS PARTNER

49
00:04:16,875 --> 00:04:17,833
{\an8}Francesco.

50
00:04:18,458 --> 00:04:21,583
{\an8}- Good morning, Francesco.
- Cico na lang.

51
00:04:22,291 --> 00:04:23,125
{\an8}Cico.

52
00:04:25,666 --> 00:04:28,415
Sumunod ka sa 'kin,
si Blanket na ang bahala sa bag mo.

53
00:04:28,416 --> 00:04:31,290
Susundan kita
hanggang sa pintuan ni San Pedro.

54
00:04:31,291 --> 00:04:34,207
{\an8}Sige lang, Francesco.
Iwan mo sa 'kin 'yong mga maleta!

55
00:04:34,208 --> 00:04:35,375
<i>Ciao,</i> Susie!

56
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:38,833
Susie. Susie. Susie.

57
00:04:39,333 --> 00:04:40,915
Salamat. Good to see you.

58
00:04:40,916 --> 00:04:44,540
Ganito, may konting aberya lang
sa transaksyon natin.

59
00:04:44,541 --> 00:04:47,124
Kailangan nating pag-usapan 'yon.

60
00:04:47,125 --> 00:04:49,625
Mamaya na lang. Late na tayo.

61
00:04:50,833 --> 00:04:54,082
{\an8}- Contessa, napakaganda mo.
- Thank you, Miss Glass.

62
00:04:54,083 --> 00:04:54,958
{\an8}Tayo na?

63
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,791
{\an8}- Wag kang tatanga-tanga.
- Manahimik ka.

64
00:05:02,916 --> 00:05:05,332
Hindi ka magke-kedgeree ngayon,
Lord Hawthorne?

65
00:05:05,333 --> 00:05:06,499
{\an8}Hindi.

66
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:09,207
{\an8}Kahit gusto ko ang lasa ng curry
sa almusal,

67
00:05:09,208 --> 00:05:10,999
{\an8}wala pa ring makakatalo sa kipper.

68
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,790
Nakilala mo na pala ang pamangkin ko.

69
00:05:12,791 --> 00:05:15,291
Oo nga. Ang guwapong bata.

70
00:05:15,875 --> 00:05:17,041
Ang tatay niya?

71
00:05:17,625 --> 00:05:19,165
Darating siya mamayang dinner.

72
00:05:19,166 --> 00:05:22,040
Maganda 'yan, nagtatrabaho siya.

73
00:05:22,041 --> 00:05:24,249
Pero tulad ni Eddie,
subsob siya sa trabaho.

74
00:05:24,250 --> 00:05:26,582
Kailan pa naging trabaho ang shooting, Ma?

75
00:05:26,583 --> 00:05:28,374
<i>Buongiorno il Duce!</i>

76
00:05:28,375 --> 00:05:31,666
Na-late kami.
Pero hindi pa late para sa almusal.

77
00:05:34,125 --> 00:05:35,000
Eddie.

78
00:05:35,791 --> 00:05:36,915
Edoardo.

79
00:05:36,916 --> 00:05:38,249
Ed-weirdo.

80
00:05:38,250 --> 00:05:39,374
Kumusta ka na?

81
00:05:39,375 --> 00:05:41,375
<i>- Ciao.</i>
- Good to see you. 'Lika nga dito.

82
00:05:43,833 --> 00:05:45,582
Pasensiya na, ha.

83
00:05:45,583 --> 00:05:49,290
Sumugod kasi 'tong piloto ko
sa letseng bagyo, e.

84
00:05:49,291 --> 00:05:50,875
Hindi kami umabot sa mata.

85
00:05:52,708 --> 00:05:54,207
Ang mahalaga, nakarating kayo.

86
00:05:54,208 --> 00:05:56,749
Walang bagyo. Nag-iinarte lang siya.

87
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:58,290
Hindi pa tayo nagkakilala.

88
00:05:58,291 --> 00:06:00,874
Masyado kang pormal.
Kaya gustong-gusto kita, e.

89
00:06:00,875 --> 00:06:03,332
Girlfriend ko,
si Contessa Isabella Soranza de Parme.

90
00:06:03,333 --> 00:06:05,041
- Nice to meet you.
- Your Grace.

91
00:06:06,583 --> 00:06:08,166
- Maupo kayo.
- Thank you.

92
00:06:10,708 --> 00:06:11,624
Hello.

93
00:06:11,625 --> 00:06:15,125
At paano kayo naging parte
ng aristocratic jigsaw puzzle na 'to?

94
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:18,832
Wala. Nandito lang kami
para i‑represent ang proletariat.

95
00:06:18,833 --> 00:06:20,749
Napakamoderno naman.

96
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:23,707
Napakaganda n'yong mga nilalang.

97
00:06:23,708 --> 00:06:25,750
Bagong mundo na 'to, Your Lordship.

98
00:06:26,833 --> 00:06:28,707
Ang ganda ng accent mo. Pakiulit nga.

99
00:06:28,708 --> 00:06:30,416
Papalapit na ang pagbabago, kapatid.

100
00:06:31,041 --> 00:06:34,415
Guilty as charged.
Sige na. Halika, maupo ka.

101
00:06:34,416 --> 00:06:37,874
- Kakausapin ko ba siya sa pananalita niya?
- Mabuti pa nga.

102
00:06:37,875 --> 00:06:41,207
Iniisip ko kung puwede sana,

103
00:06:41,208 --> 00:06:44,291
mag-usap tayo sandali kasama si Susie

104
00:06:44,958 --> 00:06:46,665
bago magsimula ang bang-bang.

105
00:06:46,666 --> 00:06:49,208
Kahit sandali lang.
Tungkol lang sa negosyo.

106
00:06:51,833 --> 00:06:53,083
Mamaya na 'yan.

107
00:06:53,625 --> 00:06:55,707
Gusto ni Geoff, nakapuwesto tayo ng 9:30.

108
00:06:55,708 --> 00:06:58,541
Ayaw naman nating
ma-disappoint siya, di ba?

109
00:07:00,750 --> 00:07:03,125
Wag kang mag-alala, Cico.
May buong umaga tayo.

110
00:07:05,625 --> 00:07:06,625
Okay.

111
00:07:08,041 --> 00:07:08,957
Sige.

112
00:07:08,958 --> 00:07:12,499
{\an8}Paano nagagawa ng mga English
kumain ng curry at isda sa almusal?

113
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:14,124
{\an8}Curry at isda!

114
00:07:14,125 --> 00:07:15,416
{\an8}Nakakadiri.

115
00:07:16,125 --> 00:07:18,457
<i>Maligalig siya, Susan. Nag-aalala ako.</i>

116
00:07:18,458 --> 00:07:20,624
Ano'ng problema kay Cico?

117
00:07:20,625 --> 00:07:22,000
Hindi pa natin alam.

118
00:07:22,583 --> 00:07:24,458
Siguradong hindi maganda.

119
00:07:24,958 --> 00:07:26,790
Alam kong di mo siya gusto,

120
00:07:26,791 --> 00:07:29,165
pero tinulungan niya tayong
makapasok sa Italy,

121
00:07:29,166 --> 00:07:32,165
isang teritoryong puno ng halimaw
sa bawat sulok.

122
00:07:32,166 --> 00:07:34,457
Wag nating balewalain ang ginawa niya.

123
00:07:34,458 --> 00:07:37,207
Ang fixer, tagaayos ng problema,
hindi tagagawa.

124
00:07:37,208 --> 00:07:40,290
Magtiwala muna tayo sa kanya sa ngayon.

125
00:07:40,291 --> 00:07:43,790
Ibuhos mo na lang muna ang effort mo
sa pagkuha ng peerage,

126
00:07:43,791 --> 00:07:45,333
tulad ng gusto ng papa ko.

127
00:07:45,916 --> 00:07:48,041
Ako na ang bahala kay Lord Hawthorne.

128
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:57,124
Sana di gano'n karami
ang aasikasuhin natin ngayon.

129
00:07:57,125 --> 00:08:00,500
Hindi pagpatay ng ibon ang goal ng shoot.
Tungkol 'yon sa pakikipag-deal.

130
00:08:01,083 --> 00:08:03,624
Alibi para magsama-sama
ang iba't ibang klase ng tuso.

131
00:08:03,625 --> 00:08:06,832
Habang mas marami ang inaasikaso,
mas maganda.

132
00:08:06,833 --> 00:08:10,040
Lilipad pa sila ng libong milya
para lang sa shoot sa England,

133
00:08:10,041 --> 00:08:11,624
at sa kung anong dahilan,

134
00:08:11,625 --> 00:08:14,125
mas madali silang kausapin
kapag may hawak silang baril.

135
00:08:15,125 --> 00:08:18,124
- Okay ba 'tong kaibigan mo?
- Magugustuhan mo si Aisha.

136
00:08:18,125 --> 00:08:20,165
Matalino. May ambisyon.

137
00:08:20,166 --> 00:08:22,999
Inaalagaan ang sarili niya
at lahat ng nasa paligid niya.

138
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,332
Lumipat siya sa Middle East
five years ago, nagtrabaho sa hospitality.

139
00:08:26,333 --> 00:08:28,749
Ngayon, nakaupo na siya sa royal table.

140
00:08:28,750 --> 00:08:30,541
Nasa Middle East ang bukas, Susie.

141
00:08:31,291 --> 00:08:33,707
Kada dalawang linggo,
may bago silang ginagawa do'n.

142
00:08:33,708 --> 00:08:36,708
Alam ko kung ba't gusto mo siya dito.
Gusto ko 'yang ambisyon mo.

143
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:39,875
Hello. Kumusta ka na?

144
00:08:40,625 --> 00:08:41,540
Ito ang Duke.

145
00:08:41,541 --> 00:08:42,707
Kumusta?

146
00:08:42,708 --> 00:08:45,665
Mabuti naman.
Salamat sa pag-imbita sa 'min.

147
00:08:45,666 --> 00:08:49,790
His Excellency,
Prince Amir bin Abdullah al-Hadid.

148
00:08:49,791 --> 00:08:50,625
Aba.

149
00:08:51,291 --> 00:08:52,832
Good morning, Sheikh Amir.

150
00:08:52,833 --> 00:08:55,999
Your Grace. Salamat sa pag-imbita sa 'min
sa maganda mong tahanan.

151
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,375
- Oo naman.
- May dala ako para sa 'yo.

152
00:08:58,875 --> 00:09:01,707
Double Magnum ng Petrus '09. Galante.

153
00:09:01,708 --> 00:09:04,540
Parang nasobrahan naman yata
ang ginawa mo.

154
00:09:04,541 --> 00:09:05,832
Mabait 'yan.

155
00:09:05,833 --> 00:09:08,832
Pangalawa sa trono. Mahilig mag-enjoy.

156
00:09:08,833 --> 00:09:10,665
At mas marami pa siyang pera kesa…

157
00:09:10,666 --> 00:09:12,540
Basta, saksakan ng yaman 'yan.

158
00:09:12,541 --> 00:09:14,207
Hayaan mo na kung nasobrahan ako.

159
00:09:14,208 --> 00:09:16,582
Di mo sinabing
mukhang artista pala 'yong Duke mo.

160
00:09:16,583 --> 00:09:20,082
{\an8}Pasensiya na sa accent ko.
Matagal na akong di nakapunta sa Gulf.

161
00:09:20,083 --> 00:09:21,874
{\an8}Saan ka natuto?

162
00:09:21,875 --> 00:09:25,207
- Ano, marunong din siyang mag-Arabic?
- Pagaling nang pagaling.

163
00:09:25,208 --> 00:09:27,749
{\an8}Nag-aral ako ng Arabic

164
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:30,832
{\an8}no'ng kumuha ako
ng Theology degree sa Oxford.

165
00:09:30,833 --> 00:09:31,708
{\an8}Magaling!

166
00:09:32,583 --> 00:09:34,541
{\an8}Ito nga pala si Susie Glass.

167
00:09:35,166 --> 00:09:36,166
Asawa mo?

168
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:38,625
Asawa sa negosyo.

169
00:09:39,125 --> 00:09:41,250
Amir, ikukuha ka namin ng baril.

170
00:09:44,875 --> 00:09:48,582
Bakit ang dami?
At bakit dalawang barrel lang?

171
00:09:48,583 --> 00:09:50,333
Para may laban 'yong mga ibon, sir.

172
00:09:51,583 --> 00:09:54,791
- Alin ang pinakamaganda?
- Pinakamaganda? O pinakamalupit?

173
00:09:55,625 --> 00:09:56,458
Pareho.

174
00:09:57,500 --> 00:10:01,082
May German guns dito,
may British, at may American.

175
00:10:01,083 --> 00:10:04,874
Pero kung ang hanap mo ay may pangalan
at matagal nang kilala,

176
00:10:04,875 --> 00:10:07,083
Italian Beretta ang para sa 'yo, sir.

177
00:10:08,458 --> 00:10:10,208
Kailangan dalawa.

178
00:10:11,125 --> 00:10:13,332
Limang daang taon na nilang ginagawa 'to.

179
00:10:13,333 --> 00:10:15,999
Pinakamatagal nang gumagawa ng baril
sa buong mundo.

180
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,833
Nakikita mo 'yong ukit na 'yan?

181
00:10:18,333 --> 00:10:22,250
Dalawang taong inukit
ang magandang design na 'yan.

182
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:26,000
Napakaganda.

183
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:28,540
Walang silbi 'yan kung barilan sa Chicago,

184
00:10:28,541 --> 00:10:31,875
pero sobrang ganda gamitin
sa mga bukirin ng England.

185
00:10:36,708 --> 00:10:37,875
Parang may tumitigas, a.

186
00:10:38,458 --> 00:10:40,208
'Yan talaga ang dapat maramdaman, sir.

187
00:10:41,791 --> 00:10:44,249
Aba, bagay na bagay, a.

188
00:10:44,250 --> 00:10:46,332
'Yan ang paboritong baril ni James Bond.

189
00:10:46,333 --> 00:10:48,582
Hindi ba Walther PPK 'yon?

190
00:10:48,583 --> 00:10:50,790
Hindi. Sa libro, hindi.

191
00:10:50,791 --> 00:10:53,041
Mananalo ka kung 'yang Beretta
ang gagamitin mo.

192
00:10:53,958 --> 00:10:54,875
Geoffrey.

193
00:10:57,083 --> 00:11:00,915
Siguraduhin mong di makakalimutan
ni Lord Hawthorne ang araw na 'to.

194
00:11:00,916 --> 00:11:03,832
- Lulunurin ko siya sa mga padulas ko.
- Mabuti.

195
00:11:03,833 --> 00:11:07,416
- Meron bang para sa kanya d'yan, sir?
- Oo naman, Geoffrey.

196
00:11:08,125 --> 00:11:09,666
'Yong pinakamaganda, siyempre.

197
00:11:10,791 --> 00:11:13,875
- 'Yong Holland & Holland ni Lord Monmouth?
- Tama.

198
00:11:14,875 --> 00:11:15,875
Suwerte niya.

199
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:18,791
Ito ang pipiliin kong baril, sir.

200
00:11:28,083 --> 00:11:29,332
Geoff, Geoff.

201
00:11:29,333 --> 00:11:32,249
Sorry, ha.
Ayoko sanang maging sakit sa ulo.

202
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:34,499
Gusto ko naman 'yong loader ko,

203
00:11:34,500 --> 00:11:39,249
pero baka puwedeng 'yong taga-Essex
ang magkarga ng bala ko.

204
00:11:39,250 --> 00:11:42,415
- Titingnan ko.
- Yes! Okay, <i>grazie.</i> Tangina, sige.

205
00:11:42,416 --> 00:11:44,125
Konting hinay lang sa pananalita.

206
00:11:45,833 --> 00:11:48,958
Bisita ka ng Duke, at may mga babae dito.

207
00:11:49,666 --> 00:11:51,625
- Suggestion lang naman.
- Sige.

208
00:11:52,666 --> 00:11:53,875
Okay, makinig kayo.

209
00:11:54,416 --> 00:11:56,666
Nasa ilalim ng baso ang numbers n'yo.

210
00:11:57,166 --> 00:11:59,000
'Yan ang peg number n'yo.

211
00:11:59,583 --> 00:12:01,832
- Your Grace?
- Bottoms up.

212
00:12:01,833 --> 00:12:03,374
- Cheers.
- Chin-chin.

213
00:12:03,375 --> 00:12:04,416
Loaders?

214
00:12:18,583 --> 00:12:19,500
Galing, sir.

215
00:12:41,833 --> 00:12:43,540
Ba't di ko matamaan?

216
00:12:43,541 --> 00:12:46,207
Okay lang.
Matatamaan mo na 'yan sa susunod.

217
00:12:46,208 --> 00:12:48,832
Magaling ka pala dito, Jack.

218
00:12:48,833 --> 00:12:52,583
Tip na lang
kung gusto mong magpasalamat, sir.

219
00:12:53,625 --> 00:12:55,540
Subukan mong makatama kahit isa, Ma.

220
00:12:55,541 --> 00:13:00,375
Iha, naging masyadong palaban ka yata
mula no'ng nagtapos kang mag-aral.

221
00:13:01,291 --> 00:13:02,333
Forty.

222
00:13:02,833 --> 00:13:05,082
Aisha! Gusto ko ng ganito.

223
00:13:05,083 --> 00:13:07,915
- Ng ano?
- Ng ganito!

224
00:13:07,916 --> 00:13:09,375
Sige, magkakaro'n ka.

225
00:13:10,791 --> 00:13:12,416
Ganid kang hayop ka.

226
00:13:16,916 --> 00:13:17,833
Thank you.

227
00:13:22,625 --> 00:13:23,625
Thank you, sir.

228
00:13:25,333 --> 00:13:27,124
Ang galing mong bumaril, Bella.

229
00:13:27,125 --> 00:13:29,291
Thank you.
Para ka namang diyos kung bumaril.

230
00:13:33,458 --> 00:13:38,000
Jack, alam mo, ang galing mo kanina.
Na-relax agad ako.

231
00:13:38,583 --> 00:13:41,875
Ano kaya kung magpakapilyo tayo
at umisa pa tayo?

232
00:13:42,458 --> 00:13:45,416
- Nabasa mo ang isip ko, Your Lordship.
- Salamat, Jack.

233
00:13:46,541 --> 00:13:47,624
Eddie.

234
00:13:47,625 --> 00:13:50,457
<i>How do I love thee? Let me count the ways</i>

235
00:13:50,458 --> 00:13:52,332
Ang ganda ng drive na 'to.

236
00:13:52,333 --> 00:13:55,207
Sunod-sunod ang dating ng mga ibon,
hindi tumitigil.

237
00:13:55,208 --> 00:13:59,165
Ginalingan mo kasi, Lord Hawthorne.
Wala kang pinalampas.

238
00:13:59,166 --> 00:14:02,082
Kung ako ang tatanungin,
maganda ang mga tira ko.

239
00:14:02,083 --> 00:14:02,958
Tama ka.

240
00:14:03,958 --> 00:14:05,790
Pupunta ka sa Scotland ngayong summer?

241
00:14:05,791 --> 00:14:07,332
Sana nga, pero malabo.

242
00:14:07,333 --> 00:14:09,749
Maraming nangyayari ngayon sa gobyerno.

243
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:12,582
Oo, nabalitaan ko
ang pagkamatay ni Lord Bramlingham.

244
00:14:12,583 --> 00:14:15,249
- Nakakagulat, di ba?
- Nakakagulat talaga.

245
00:14:15,250 --> 00:14:17,665
Maghahanap siguro kayo ng kapalit niya?

246
00:14:17,666 --> 00:14:21,166
Hindi madalas mabakante ang puwesto
para sa hereditary peer.

247
00:14:21,958 --> 00:14:23,166
May naiisip na kayo?

248
00:14:26,833 --> 00:14:29,666
Bubuo kami ng shortlist ngayong weekend.

249
00:14:30,833 --> 00:14:34,790
Alam mo, dapat uminom muna tayo
bago mag-dinner.

250
00:14:34,791 --> 00:14:38,333
Noon pa man, interesado na talaga ako
sa mga ginagawa sa Parliament.

251
00:14:39,708 --> 00:14:40,875
Talaga?

252
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:47,166
Tuloy na natin.
Hindi kusang mamamatay 'yang mga ibon.

253
00:14:56,541 --> 00:14:59,499
{\an8}Bakit siya lagi ang nakakatama?

254
00:14:59,500 --> 00:15:03,750
Magmintis ka kahit isa o dalawa, sir.
Napapahiya 'yong Italyano, e.

255
00:15:04,250 --> 00:15:07,291
- May problema ka do'n?
- Ako, wala. Pero 'yong ego niya, meron.

256
00:15:08,125 --> 00:15:11,083
Sige, dayain na lang natin
'yong bilang, Geoff.

257
00:15:12,458 --> 00:15:14,458
Maganda ang takbo ng negosyo, di ba?

258
00:15:14,958 --> 00:15:16,874
No'ng isang taon, wala tayo.

259
00:15:16,875 --> 00:15:20,165
Pero no'ng sinimulan natin
'yong underground farm

260
00:15:20,166 --> 00:15:22,541
<i>sa palazzo ng Contessa, grabe!</i>

261
00:15:23,291 --> 00:15:24,833
Ang galing n'yo.

262
00:15:25,750 --> 00:15:27,790
Wala pang isang taon,
many anim na farm pa.

263
00:15:27,791 --> 00:15:30,165
Ang sabi mo may problema. Sabihin mo na.

264
00:15:30,166 --> 00:15:34,583
Oo. May problema talaga.
Ang problema, si Marco Moretti.

265
00:15:35,166 --> 00:15:36,500
Ano'ng sabi mo?

266
00:15:38,291 --> 00:15:39,166
Marco Moretti?

267
00:15:40,833 --> 00:15:42,875
Ano'ng kinalaman ni Marco Moretti dito?

268
00:15:43,458 --> 00:15:45,165
Kausapin natin siya.

269
00:15:45,166 --> 00:15:48,458
Kaya nga ikaw ang kausap namin,
para di na umabot kay <i>El Capo Di Capi.</i>

270
00:15:50,041 --> 00:15:52,499
Oo nga. Pero nakatunog siya, e.

271
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:55,915
Nalaman niya 'yong marijuana farm
sa palazzo ng Contessa.

272
00:15:55,916 --> 00:15:59,457
Ninong siya ng Contessa.
Malalaman at malalaman niya rin.

273
00:15:59,458 --> 00:16:03,541
Ngayon, gusto niyang makiparte.
Kung hindi, wawasakin niya 'yon.

274
00:16:04,125 --> 00:16:06,499
{\an8}MARCO MORETTI
BOSS NG MGA BOSS

275
00:16:06,500 --> 00:16:08,749
{\an8}Teka, sasadsad kami nito, Cico.

276
00:16:08,750 --> 00:16:10,915
{\an8}Tinulak mo kami palabas
nang walang parachute.

277
00:16:10,916 --> 00:16:13,624
<i>Ang sabi mo, di malalaman ni Marco 'to.</i>

278
00:16:13,625 --> 00:16:16,249
Nasaan na si Mr. Consistent?
Si Mr. Reliable?

279
00:16:16,250 --> 00:16:19,665
Italy 'yon. Gulatan lagi, okay?

280
00:16:19,666 --> 00:16:22,624
Kaya nga nandito ako
para mapigilan ko ang problema.

281
00:16:22,625 --> 00:16:25,082
Magkano para mapigilan ang problema?

282
00:16:25,083 --> 00:16:25,916
Siguro…

283
00:16:27,250 --> 00:16:28,332
kuwarenta kada taon?

284
00:16:28,333 --> 00:16:31,332
Kuwarentang ano?
Kuwarentang lira? Kuwarentang siesta?

285
00:16:31,333 --> 00:16:33,707
Kuwarentang hagupit?
Kuwarentang gabi sa disyerto?

286
00:16:33,708 --> 00:16:35,207
Kuwarentang ano, Cico?

287
00:16:35,208 --> 00:16:37,707
Kuwarenta mil, siyempre.

288
00:16:37,708 --> 00:16:40,290
- Okay, wag na.
- Teka, teka, sandali.

289
00:16:40,291 --> 00:16:44,500
Okay. Sige. Sobra nga naman 'yong 40.

290
00:16:45,083 --> 00:16:46,707
Kaya nga binabayaran n'yo 'ko.

291
00:16:46,708 --> 00:16:48,957
May naisip akong solusyon.

292
00:16:48,958 --> 00:16:51,332
Malaking problema 'to, Francesco,

293
00:16:51,333 --> 00:16:54,082
kaya dapat lang na malaki
ang putanginang solusyon na 'yan.

294
00:16:54,083 --> 00:16:59,000
Gaano ka kapamilyar
sa mga gawa ni Botticelli?

295
00:17:00,583 --> 00:17:04,541
<i>May ibebentang painting niya
sa isang auction house sa London.</i>

296
00:17:05,250 --> 00:17:07,457
<i>Obsessed si Marco sa mga gawa niya.</i>

297
00:17:07,458 --> 00:17:08,707
<i>Malaking halaga 'yon.</i>

298
00:17:08,708 --> 00:17:12,290
Hindi malaki ang six million
kung makukuha naman natin ang gusto natin.

299
00:17:12,291 --> 00:17:14,957
Malupit ang organisasyon ni Marco Moretti.

300
00:17:14,958 --> 00:17:17,957
May extortion, kidnap, torture,
lahat 'yon, ginagawa nila.

301
00:17:17,958 --> 00:17:20,665
At malakas sila sa simbahan
at sa gobyerno.

302
00:17:20,666 --> 00:17:22,791
Wala akong duda sa lakas ni Marco Moretti.

303
00:17:24,041 --> 00:17:26,249
Alam ko kung ga'no kahalaga at kaganda

304
00:17:26,250 --> 00:17:29,291
ang mabili ang painting
ng paborito niyang Renaissance artist.

305
00:17:29,916 --> 00:17:34,915
Ang tanong lang, si Cico ba
ang pinakamagandang paraan maabot siya?

306
00:17:34,916 --> 00:17:38,499
Alam kong hindi mo siya gusto.
Mas lalong di ko siya gusto.

307
00:17:38,500 --> 00:17:41,915
Pero kailangan natin siya.
Kahit pansamantala lang.

308
00:17:41,916 --> 00:17:44,625
Di mo naman kailangang magustuhan
lahat ng katrabaho mo.

309
00:17:47,708 --> 00:17:49,375
Alam ko kung sino'ng gusto mo.

310
00:17:50,708 --> 00:17:52,000
Ano'ng ibig sabihin no'n?

311
00:17:52,708 --> 00:17:54,415
Depende sa gusto mo.

312
00:17:54,416 --> 00:17:55,832
O, ten-minute warning, ha.

313
00:17:55,833 --> 00:17:56,916
Ten minutes.

314
00:18:02,958 --> 00:18:05,125
{\an8}Punyeta, di ako makatama kahit isa.

315
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:10,291
{\an8}Tangina, ano ba'ng gagawin ko?

316
00:18:12,083 --> 00:18:13,208
Thank you.

317
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,041
Hoy!

318
00:18:19,041 --> 00:18:21,082
{\an8}Ba't tingin ka nang tingin do'n?

319
00:18:21,083 --> 00:18:21,999
{\an8}Ano?

320
00:18:22,000 --> 00:18:24,207
{\an8}Tingin ka nang tingin sa Duke!

321
00:18:24,208 --> 00:18:26,790
{\an8}Hindi ako nakatingin sa Duke.
Bumabaril ako.

322
00:18:26,791 --> 00:18:29,332
{\an8}Lagi mo na lang akong binubuwisit, e!

323
00:18:29,333 --> 00:18:30,832
{\an8}Selos ka nang selos!

324
00:18:30,833 --> 00:18:32,874
{\an8}Kahit sa'n na lang tayo magpunta!

325
00:18:32,875 --> 00:18:33,791
{\an8}Ano ka, vegan?

326
00:18:36,416 --> 00:18:37,500
Cico!

327
00:18:38,750 --> 00:18:39,583
Cico!

328
00:18:40,208 --> 00:18:42,583
Sandali lang! Wala munang babaril!

329
00:18:44,375 --> 00:18:46,791
Cico. Cico.

330
00:18:47,375 --> 00:18:48,291
Patay na ba?

331
00:18:49,250 --> 00:18:50,499
Ayos lang siya.

332
00:18:50,500 --> 00:18:53,457
Tinamaan siya ng ibon.
Di kadalasang nakakamatay 'yon.

333
00:18:53,458 --> 00:18:54,416
"Di kadalasan"?

334
00:18:55,208 --> 00:18:56,541
{\an8}Sayang naman.

335
00:18:57,208 --> 00:18:59,666
Cico? Cico, ano ba?

336
00:19:02,333 --> 00:19:04,790
Ang tanga niya.
Wag nating bilhin 'yong painting.

337
00:19:04,791 --> 00:19:07,624
Suwerte mo pag di na siya naka-recover
sa tumama sa kanya.

338
00:19:07,625 --> 00:19:10,332
- Papatayin ako ng ibon.
- Mag-focus ka kay Lord Hawthorne.

339
00:19:10,333 --> 00:19:12,957
Lord na kapos sa pera,
bahay na napabayaan na.

340
00:19:12,958 --> 00:19:14,500
Madali na lang 'yon.

341
00:19:22,458 --> 00:19:25,874
Oo, matanda na ako, mukhang walang silbi,

342
00:19:25,875 --> 00:19:28,083
pero alam ko kapag may kailangan sa 'kin.

343
00:19:28,708 --> 00:19:32,624
'Yong mga ibon,
'yong pagkain, itong Petrus.

344
00:19:32,625 --> 00:19:33,624
Alam ko 'yon.

345
00:19:33,625 --> 00:19:36,665
At nagpapasalamat ako, Eddie. Totoo.

346
00:19:36,666 --> 00:19:38,875
Pero alam ko ang pakay mo.

347
00:19:39,375 --> 00:19:40,875
Nagpapadulas ka sa 'kin.

348
00:19:41,458 --> 00:19:43,291
Nilalangisan mo 'ko.

349
00:19:44,583 --> 00:19:48,416
Umaasa ka ng suporta ko
sa plano mong maging hereditary peer.

350
00:19:49,541 --> 00:19:51,708
Importanteng tao ka, Lord Hawthorne.

351
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:57,041
Tama lang na makatanggap ka
ng mga nararapat na regalo.

352
00:19:57,916 --> 00:20:00,708
At kaya siguro gusto mo ng posisyong 'to

353
00:20:01,333 --> 00:20:04,624
ay para maimpluwensyahan mo ang bill

354
00:20:04,625 --> 00:20:07,958
na nagpo-propose
na gawing legal ang marijuana.

355
00:20:09,583 --> 00:20:11,624
Ano naman ang pakialam ko do'n?

356
00:20:11,625 --> 00:20:13,249
Hindi ko alam, Eddie.

357
00:20:13,250 --> 00:20:16,040
Kung ano man ang dahilan mo,
wala na ako do'n.

358
00:20:16,041 --> 00:20:19,165
Ang gusto kong malaman,
kung magkano sa tingin mo ang presyo ko.

359
00:20:19,166 --> 00:20:20,833
Kaya wag na nating patagalin 'to.

360
00:20:23,541 --> 00:20:24,999
Ano ang naisip mo?

361
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,124
<i>Lord na kapos sa pera,
bahay na napabayaan na.</i>

362
00:20:27,125 --> 00:20:28,374
Madali na lang 'yon.

363
00:20:28,375 --> 00:20:30,374
Magkano ang offer mo? Two million?

364
00:20:30,375 --> 00:20:32,332
Hindi, 'no. Mga 100,000 lang.

365
00:20:32,333 --> 00:20:33,666
Nagpapatawa ka ba?

366
00:20:35,250 --> 00:20:37,415
£50,000?

367
00:20:37,416 --> 00:20:38,749
PRESYO NG KAPOS SA PERA

368
00:20:38,750 --> 00:20:41,749
Magugulat ka sa kayang gawin
ng mga politiko para sa pera.

369
00:20:41,750 --> 00:20:44,375
Kung magagawa mo 'yon,
sagot ko na ang meal deal.

370
00:20:46,083 --> 00:20:49,624
Pasensiya na, pero hindi ko kaya 'yan,
Lord Hawthorne.

371
00:20:49,625 --> 00:20:52,624
Sige, ubusin mo na lang 'yong Petrus.

372
00:20:52,625 --> 00:20:53,458
Thirty-five.

373
00:20:56,583 --> 00:20:57,540
Twenty-five.

374
00:20:57,541 --> 00:20:58,625
Thirty.

375
00:21:00,125 --> 00:21:03,874
{\an8}MATITIPID: £1,970,000

376
00:21:03,875 --> 00:21:07,374
Kailangan ko ng endorsement mo
sa nominasyon ko bilang hereditary peer,

377
00:21:07,375 --> 00:21:09,540
pati na rin ang suporta ng mga kaibigan mo

378
00:21:09,541 --> 00:21:13,040
na mapapapayag mo
kung maayos mo silang kakausapin,

379
00:21:13,041 --> 00:21:17,207
at sa gano'ng paraan, garantisado na
ang puwesto ko sa House of Lords.

380
00:21:17,208 --> 00:21:19,082
Kung kailangan ko pa ng tulong

381
00:21:19,083 --> 00:21:21,582
para makaimpluwensya
sa partikular na bill,

382
00:21:21,583 --> 00:21:25,500
pag-usapan na lang natin 'yan
kapag dumating ang panahon.

383
00:21:28,541 --> 00:21:30,583
Okay na 'yang offer mo.

384
00:21:32,333 --> 00:21:37,500
{\an8}May isa pala akong kondisyon
na kailangang makuha ko.

385
00:21:38,083 --> 00:21:39,416
{\an8}Ano 'yon?

386
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:40,833
{\an8}Si Jack.

387
00:21:44,166 --> 00:21:45,624
{\an8}Si Jack?

388
00:21:45,625 --> 00:21:47,499
Si Jack, 'yong loader.

389
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:48,999
Interesado ako sa kanya.

390
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:51,958
Sige. Paanong interesado?

391
00:21:52,666 --> 00:21:54,291
Anthropologically.

392
00:21:55,291 --> 00:21:57,333
Bihira ang nilalang na tulad niya, Eddie.

393
00:21:57,958 --> 00:22:00,749
Nasa kanya ang mabangis na lakas

394
00:22:00,750 --> 00:22:05,416
<i>ng matagal nang nakalimutang
sinaunang tao.</i>

395
00:22:09,375 --> 00:22:11,415
{\an8}Sige, gagawan ko ng paraan.

396
00:22:11,416 --> 00:22:15,500
{\an8}30,000 + JACK + BURAT NI JACK

397
00:22:16,708 --> 00:22:17,915
Magandang gabi sa inyo.

398
00:22:17,916 --> 00:22:21,082
Sana nag-enjoy kayo
ngayong araw sa Halstead Manor.

399
00:22:21,083 --> 00:22:23,041
Ito ang mga nakuha natin
ngayong araw, sir.

400
00:22:23,541 --> 00:22:29,874
120 partridge, dalawang wood pigeon,
at isang Italian businessman.

401
00:22:29,875 --> 00:22:33,374
Ang bad news,
ang Duke ang nasa huling puwesto.

402
00:22:33,375 --> 00:22:35,666
94 na tira, pero iilan lang ang tinamaan.

403
00:22:36,250 --> 00:22:38,457
Kasalanan ng instructor ko 'yan, Geoffrey.

404
00:22:38,458 --> 00:22:40,749
Ako na ang kakausap sa kanya, sir.

405
00:22:40,750 --> 00:22:41,874
Ang good news,

406
00:22:41,875 --> 00:22:44,624
nabawi ng ating Ladyship
ang pangalan ng pamilya.

407
00:22:44,625 --> 00:22:48,499
Sampung ibon, sunod-sunod,
at siya rin ang best dressed sa field.

408
00:22:48,500 --> 00:22:49,875
- Totoo 'yan.
- Salamat.

409
00:22:51,541 --> 00:22:52,916
Your Grace, Your Ladyship,

410
00:22:53,750 --> 00:22:55,083
ladies and gentlemen.

411
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:56,833
Salamat.

412
00:23:01,083 --> 00:23:04,833
Gusto kong magbigay ng toast

413
00:23:06,083 --> 00:23:08,707
kay Edoardo, ang pinakagalanteng host.

414
00:23:08,708 --> 00:23:12,290
Napakalaking karangalan
na maimbitahan dito sa England

415
00:23:12,291 --> 00:23:15,290
para makisalo sa tradisyon ninyo

416
00:23:15,291 --> 00:23:16,790
at sa mga…

417
00:23:16,791 --> 00:23:19,000
nakaka‑inspire ninyong pananaw

418
00:23:19,916 --> 00:23:21,250
para sa mas magandang bukas.

419
00:23:23,958 --> 00:23:25,041
Your Grace.

420
00:23:25,625 --> 00:23:27,290
- Eddie.
- Edward.

421
00:23:27,291 --> 00:23:28,416
Cheers.

422
00:23:29,666 --> 00:23:31,000
- Halika na?
- Sige.

423
00:23:33,416 --> 00:23:35,165
Ba't di ka uminom?

424
00:23:35,166 --> 00:23:38,457
Di naman gano'n ang ginagawa
kapag tungkol sa 'yo ang toast, di ba?

425
00:23:38,458 --> 00:23:40,082
Lumihis na tayo sa nakaugalian.

426
00:23:40,083 --> 00:23:43,540
Hindi tama ang mag-toast
bago pa man tayo makaupo.

427
00:23:43,541 --> 00:23:45,290
Sa tingin mo, walang modo si Cico?

428
00:23:45,291 --> 00:23:48,290
Sinasabi lang ni Lord Hawthorne
ang pagkakaiba

429
00:23:48,291 --> 00:23:50,500
ng Italian at English tradition, di ba?

430
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:55,290
Wala siyang modo.

431
00:23:55,291 --> 00:23:57,957
Parang nagkamali yata 'yong gamekeeper.

432
00:23:57,958 --> 00:24:01,374
Kung ako 'yon,
sa 'yo ko ibibigay ang best dressed award.

433
00:24:01,375 --> 00:24:05,207
Ang version ni Cico ng pagiging classy,
regaluhan ako ng guhit-guhit na lion.

434
00:24:05,208 --> 00:24:07,125
- Baka tiger?
- Basta 'yon na 'yon.

435
00:24:07,958 --> 00:24:10,624
- Sabrina, sandali lang.
- Sige lang.

436
00:24:10,625 --> 00:24:13,999
- Aisha, puwedeng samahan mo 'ko?
- Sige, susunod ako.

437
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:16,333
Wala ka yatang suwerte
sa mga ibon ngayon, Cico?

438
00:24:18,208 --> 00:24:20,333
- Paano kayo nagkakilala?
- Sa party.

439
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,457
Nagbebenta siya ng cocaine.

440
00:24:22,458 --> 00:24:25,082
Bago 'yon, a. Bumibili ka?

441
00:24:25,083 --> 00:24:26,333
Hindi, 'no.

442
00:24:27,750 --> 00:24:30,165
Oo, wala siyang manners at clumsy siya,

443
00:24:30,166 --> 00:24:32,207
pero mataas ang ambisyon niya.

444
00:24:32,208 --> 00:24:33,750
At 'yon ang nagustuhan ko.

445
00:24:35,791 --> 00:24:38,874
'Yong clumsiness niya,
'yon ang inaayos niya.

446
00:24:38,875 --> 00:24:43,125
Nati-trigger mo ang insecurity niya
kaya nagiging mainitin ang ulo niya.

447
00:24:44,500 --> 00:24:47,499
Ikaw, Eddie? Ano'ng mga ambisyon mo?

448
00:24:47,500 --> 00:24:48,541
Ako?

449
00:24:49,125 --> 00:24:52,332
Paano ka nakakasiguro
na hindi ako iresponsableng aristocrat

450
00:24:52,333 --> 00:24:54,291
na kontento nang mabuhay
sa paubos na yaman?

451
00:24:55,416 --> 00:24:58,250
Dahil hindi ka iresponsable, Your Grace.

452
00:24:59,750 --> 00:25:02,582
Naniniwala ka sa 'kin.

453
00:25:02,583 --> 00:25:03,833
Oo.

454
00:25:24,916 --> 00:25:26,583
Excuse me, may kailangan ka?

455
00:25:31,583 --> 00:25:32,708
Ewan ko.

456
00:25:33,458 --> 00:25:34,416
Meron ba?

457
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,250
Naliligaw ka ba?

458
00:25:37,750 --> 00:25:40,416
Oo. Parang nasa panaginip ako.

459
00:25:41,833 --> 00:25:44,708
Ito ang pinakamagandang sasakyan
na nakita ko.

460
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,041
Kung gano'n,

461
00:25:50,250 --> 00:25:51,958
gigisingin kita sa panaginip mo.

462
00:25:59,541 --> 00:26:01,582
- Darling.
- Darling.

463
00:26:01,583 --> 00:26:02,707
Bag n'yo, sir?

464
00:26:02,708 --> 00:26:05,082
Salamat, Mr. Lawrence.

465
00:26:05,083 --> 00:26:08,124
Sorry kung ngayon lang ako.
Sorry din sa suot ko.

466
00:26:08,125 --> 00:26:09,625
May konting problema sa trabaho.

467
00:26:10,208 --> 00:26:13,416
- Tulog na ba ang anak ko?
- Kakatulog lang niya.

468
00:26:15,416 --> 00:26:17,624
Halika na, mukhang gutom ka na.

469
00:26:17,625 --> 00:26:22,957
Hindi ako aalis hangga't di mo sinasabi
kung kanino ang magandang sasakyang 'to.

470
00:26:22,958 --> 00:26:26,208
Pero pagkatapos ng lahat,
erotic dancer pala siya mula Corinth.

471
00:26:27,500 --> 00:26:28,958
Kilala kita.

472
00:26:30,375 --> 00:26:32,832
Alam mo ba kung ilang
Mark VI Drophead Coupé

473
00:26:32,833 --> 00:26:34,416
ang ginawa ni Franay?

474
00:26:36,250 --> 00:26:38,250
- Kakaunti lang?
- Eighteen.

475
00:26:38,750 --> 00:26:41,500
Kumusta, Lord Hawthorne?
Ako si Nanny Asante.

476
00:26:42,125 --> 00:26:43,540
Pero Nanny na lang.

477
00:26:43,541 --> 00:26:46,249
Ang ganda ng kotse mo. Sobrang ganda.

478
00:26:46,250 --> 00:26:48,207
Salamat, Nanny.

479
00:26:48,208 --> 00:26:50,749
Kung gano'n, subukan mong i-drive bukas.

480
00:26:50,750 --> 00:26:53,083
Naku, hindi. Wag na.

481
00:26:54,458 --> 00:26:55,541
Pero sige.

482
00:26:57,541 --> 00:26:58,916
Saan kayo nagkakilala?

483
00:26:59,666 --> 00:27:02,207
Magaling na sundalo ni Nanny.

484
00:27:02,208 --> 00:27:06,040
Ginawaran siya ng Military Cross
para sa pambihirang katapangan sa combat.

485
00:27:06,041 --> 00:27:08,332
Nagkakilala sila
sa Sandhurst Commissioners Ball.

486
00:27:08,333 --> 00:27:11,166
- Sabay kaming pumasok sa serbisyo.
- Date ako ni Eddie no'n.

487
00:27:12,625 --> 00:27:14,916
'95, sir. Paborito n'yo.

488
00:27:15,416 --> 00:27:16,583
Thank you, Mr. Lawrence.

489
00:27:17,083 --> 00:27:19,707
Pakisigurado namang naplantsa
ang jacket ko.

490
00:27:19,708 --> 00:27:21,082
Sige po.

491
00:27:21,083 --> 00:27:23,207
Isipin mo ring magkaanak, Edward.

492
00:27:23,208 --> 00:27:26,040
Ayaw mong maipasa ang lahat ng 'to
sa kapatid mo, tama?

493
00:27:26,041 --> 00:27:28,541
- Nasaan nga pala siya?
- Nagpapagaling siya.

494
00:27:29,333 --> 00:27:31,333
Ano'ng naging sakit niya?

495
00:27:31,958 --> 00:27:35,250
Sobrang dami at iba‑iba,
kaya di puwedeng pag‑usapan sa hapunan.

496
00:27:46,500 --> 00:27:49,624
Ang akala ng mga tao,
mga kabayo lang ang inaasikaso niya.

497
00:27:49,625 --> 00:27:50,707
Pero ang totoo,

498
00:27:50,708 --> 00:27:54,416
ang King's Equerry ang nagsisilbing
aide-de-camp ng British Sovereign.

499
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:58,707
Si Nanny ang kanang kamay
ng King of England.

500
00:27:58,708 --> 00:28:00,750
Wag mong sabihin kay boss. Masusulot 'yan.

501
00:28:01,791 --> 00:28:05,833
Lahat ng gusto ng English King,
gusto rin niya.

502
00:28:09,208 --> 00:28:11,207
Sigurado akong magkakasundo…

503
00:28:11,208 --> 00:28:12,665
Wine pa, wine.

504
00:28:12,666 --> 00:28:16,125
Papalitan ko ba 'yong baso?
Ibang alak na 'to. Mouton na.

505
00:28:18,416 --> 00:28:21,332
- Nasaan na 'yong Masseto?
- Ubos na.

506
00:28:21,333 --> 00:28:22,833
1989 'to.

507
00:28:23,625 --> 00:28:26,665
Oo. Hindi musty 'yan,

508
00:28:26,666 --> 00:28:28,791
kung 'yon ang inaalala mo.

509
00:28:39,958 --> 00:28:41,083
Tama.

510
00:29:04,375 --> 00:29:05,625
Sira 'yong alak.

511
00:29:08,625 --> 00:29:09,666
Mr. Lawrence.

512
00:29:10,416 --> 00:29:13,290
Alam n'yo ba, 'yong biyenan ko,

513
00:29:13,291 --> 00:29:16,790
anim na bote ang pinabalik niya,
sunod-sunod.

514
00:29:16,791 --> 00:29:22,415
Pero na-stroke pala siya
kaya nawalan siya ng panlasa.

515
00:29:22,416 --> 00:29:25,165
Bumalik din naman
pagkalipas ng ilang araw,

516
00:29:25,166 --> 00:29:28,958
pero £20,000 ang nasayang,
parang itinapon lang.

517
00:29:30,333 --> 00:29:33,333
Baka na-stroke ka na pala, Cico. Ano?

518
00:29:33,833 --> 00:29:34,833
Tama ka.

519
00:29:36,166 --> 00:29:37,666
Sira nga 'yong wine.

520
00:29:39,458 --> 00:29:41,333
Gusto mo bang pumili ng bago?

521
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:47,291
Walang Italian wine dito.

522
00:29:48,583 --> 00:29:52,041
Puwede kong ipakuha
'yong Barolo Riserva kung gusto mo.

523
00:29:52,541 --> 00:29:55,958
Puwera na lang kung medyo…
matapang sa 'yo 'yon.

524
00:29:57,208 --> 00:29:59,165
Ayaw mo ng Italian wine, 'no?

525
00:29:59,166 --> 00:30:01,999
Hindi totoo 'yan.
Hindi nga nagpahuli ang Masseto.

526
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:04,499
Ngumiwi ka no'ng sinabi mong "matapang".

527
00:30:04,500 --> 00:30:07,749
Na para bang walang binatbat
ang Italian wine sa French wine.

528
00:30:07,750 --> 00:30:11,207
Mas masarap naman talaga
ang French wine kaysa sa Italian.

529
00:30:11,208 --> 00:30:12,749
Ginagaya ng mga Italian

530
00:30:12,750 --> 00:30:15,750
ang husay ng mga French
sa nakalipas na 800 taon.

531
00:30:17,208 --> 00:30:18,083
Ginagaya?

532
00:30:20,333 --> 00:30:21,500
Ano, parang unggoy lang?

533
00:30:22,416 --> 00:30:25,874
Ang tingin mo pala sa Barolo Riserva,
alak na pang-unggoy?

534
00:30:25,875 --> 00:30:27,165
Hindi ko sinabi 'yan.

535
00:30:27,166 --> 00:30:29,582
Pasensiya na, pero 'yon ang sinabi mo.

536
00:30:29,583 --> 00:30:35,833
Mababa ang tingin mo sa Italian wine
at para lang 'yon sa mga unggoy.

537
00:30:36,708 --> 00:30:38,290
Siguro nga, tama ka.

538
00:30:38,291 --> 00:30:41,416
Ang sinasabi ko lang,
mga Italyano ang nag-imbento ng alak.

539
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:44,999
Tsinutsupa ng mga Pranses
ang mga asno nila

540
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:48,624
nang dumating ang mga Romano
at tinuruan silang gumawa ng alak.

541
00:30:48,625 --> 00:30:52,750
Iinom ng sarili nilang ihi ang mga Pranses
kung hindi dahil sa 'min.

542
00:30:54,041 --> 00:30:55,125
Nakakatuwa naman.

543
00:30:56,250 --> 00:30:58,125
Hindi sira 'yong wine, Cico.

544
00:31:00,250 --> 00:31:02,832
'Yon ang pinakamasarap ngayong gabi,
at alam mo 'yon.

545
00:31:02,833 --> 00:31:06,208
- Pinagdududahan mo ba 'ko?
- Oo, gano'n nga.

546
00:31:07,333 --> 00:31:08,499
Hindi sira ang wine.

547
00:31:08,500 --> 00:31:11,666
Kapag sinabi kong sira, e di sira.

548
00:31:12,750 --> 00:31:14,124
Italyano ako,

549
00:31:14,125 --> 00:31:17,666
at mula pa ang angkan ko
sa panahon ni Michelangelo.

550
00:31:19,125 --> 00:31:22,582
Kaya tatanungin ulit kita,
pinagdududahan mo ba 'ko?

551
00:31:22,583 --> 00:31:24,582
Kaduda-duda ang mga desisyon mo, Cico.

552
00:31:24,583 --> 00:31:27,957
Regaluhan mo ba naman ng tigre
ang girlfriend mo.

553
00:31:27,958 --> 00:31:31,291
Kung ako sa 'yo, wag mo nang gamitin
ang sinaunang angkan mo.

554
00:31:32,125 --> 00:31:33,958
Ngayon naman, mababang uri ako?

555
00:31:35,625 --> 00:31:36,958
Hay naku, Cico.

556
00:31:37,625 --> 00:31:43,083
Kung mababang uri ka man o aristokrata,
may halaga ka. Pero wala ka do'n, e.

557
00:31:43,958 --> 00:31:47,290
Ipinanganak ka sa putikan
ng pagiging karaniwan.

558
00:31:47,291 --> 00:31:50,290
Ikaw 'yong walang utak na anak
ng nagbebenta ng lumang sasakyan

559
00:31:50,291 --> 00:31:55,375
na yumaman lang sa pagbebenta
ng Fiat <i>Cinquecento</i> sa suburban Turin.

560
00:32:00,083 --> 00:32:04,375
{\an8}Putangina mo,
bumangon sana lahat ng mga ninuno mo.

561
00:32:21,708 --> 00:32:23,375
{\an8}Mag-iingat ka, Cico.

562
00:32:25,416 --> 00:32:26,916
{\an8}Good night.

563
00:33:01,750 --> 00:33:02,833
Nandito ang Duke.

564
00:33:06,750 --> 00:33:10,750
Siguraduhin mong nasa kotse
ni Lord Hawthorne 'yong brace of grays.

565
00:33:11,250 --> 00:33:12,541
Isama mo rin 'to.

566
00:33:13,125 --> 00:33:14,915
Double Magnum ng Petrus?

567
00:33:14,916 --> 00:33:16,415
Ayos na ayos na 'to.

568
00:33:16,416 --> 00:33:17,791
Gagawin ko na agad.

569
00:33:18,541 --> 00:33:19,875
Sige lang, Geoff.

570
00:33:27,125 --> 00:33:29,457
Naayos mo na 'yong sa Italian?

571
00:33:29,458 --> 00:33:31,290
Malaking problema siya, Susie.

572
00:33:31,291 --> 00:33:33,374
Masama ang kutob ko sa Botticelli na 'yon.

573
00:33:33,375 --> 00:33:36,665
Salita lang niya ang hawak natin
na aabot 'yon sa destinasyon.

574
00:33:36,666 --> 00:33:38,915
Alam kong ayaw mong bilhin
'yong Botticelli.

575
00:33:38,916 --> 00:33:41,083
Pero dapat pa rin nating
kausapin ang papa ko.

576
00:33:42,833 --> 00:33:44,791
May napala ka ba kay Lord Hawthorne?

577
00:33:46,291 --> 00:33:49,125
- May presyo na kami.
- Sagot ko na ba ang Happy Meal?

578
00:33:49,833 --> 00:33:51,625
Pero may maliit na kondisyon.

579
00:33:52,208 --> 00:33:53,166
Kondisyon?

580
00:33:53,750 --> 00:33:55,875
Interesado siya kay Jack.

581
00:33:56,458 --> 00:33:58,499
Sige. Anong klaseng interes?

582
00:33:58,500 --> 00:33:59,916
'Yong anthropological.

583
00:34:00,791 --> 00:34:02,958
- Ano'ng ibig sabihin no'n?
- Ganito.

584
00:34:03,958 --> 00:34:07,374
Gusto niyang isama si Jack sa dinner,
baka manood ng opera,

585
00:34:07,375 --> 00:34:09,458
tapos, alam mo na,

586
00:34:09,958 --> 00:34:11,333
hihimas-himasin niya.

587
00:34:13,791 --> 00:34:15,249
Hindi problema 'yan.

588
00:34:15,250 --> 00:34:17,165
lkaw na ang magsabi sa tatay ko

589
00:34:17,166 --> 00:34:19,583
na kailangang paligayahin ng anak niya
ang isang lord.

590
00:34:21,583 --> 00:34:22,916
Ako na ang bahala.

591
00:34:31,375 --> 00:34:33,958
Alam mo ba 'yong kuwento
tungkol sa Bannik?

592
00:34:35,041 --> 00:34:35,875
Oo.

593
00:34:36,958 --> 00:34:38,207
'Yong nag-iibang anyo

594
00:34:38,208 --> 00:34:42,082
na madalas daw sa steam rooms
ng Northern Europe.

595
00:34:42,083 --> 00:34:45,625
Ang sabi sa kuwento, 'yong Bannik mo…

596
00:34:46,458 --> 00:34:49,208
malokong espiritu daw 'yon.

597
00:34:50,375 --> 00:34:54,415
Minsan, nag-aanyo siyang hubad na lalaki,

598
00:34:54,416 --> 00:34:57,790
hinihimas ang balbas
at humihithit ng tabako.

599
00:34:57,791 --> 00:35:00,124
Pero mag-iingat ka.

600
00:35:00,125 --> 00:35:03,416
Baka may iba pang espiritu na makapasok.

601
00:35:04,083 --> 00:35:09,290
Kung hihingi ka ng payo sa kanya,
siguraduhin mong babayaran mo siya.

602
00:35:09,291 --> 00:35:13,625
Dahil kung hindi,
kung ano-anong gulo ang gagawin niya.

603
00:35:14,833 --> 00:35:15,916
Pero buti na lang,

604
00:35:17,083 --> 00:35:18,208
merong…

605
00:35:19,208 --> 00:35:22,915
ibang ritwal na puwedeng gamitin
para mapasaya ang Bannik.

606
00:35:22,916 --> 00:35:25,541
Ang mga ritwal na 'to, puwedeng…

607
00:35:26,041 --> 00:35:28,249
pagsakal sa manok na may itim na balahibo

608
00:35:28,250 --> 00:35:31,790
at pagkatapos ay ilibing 'to
sa ilalim ng steam house mo.

609
00:35:31,791 --> 00:35:33,375
O kaya naman,

610
00:35:34,041 --> 00:35:37,708
mag-alay ka sa kanya ng sanga ng fir
pagkatapos mong mag-steam

611
00:35:38,291 --> 00:35:39,833
at magpasalamat ka.

612
00:35:40,500 --> 00:35:42,875
Pero siguraduhin mong babayaran mo siya.

613
00:35:43,875 --> 00:35:47,249
Pero alam mo,
may pakinabang din ang Bannik.

614
00:35:47,250 --> 00:35:48,790
Ano naman 'yon, Pa?

615
00:35:48,791 --> 00:35:51,000
Nakikita niya ang hinaharap.

616
00:35:53,750 --> 00:35:55,166
Ituturo ko kung paano.

617
00:35:57,666 --> 00:36:00,249
Tumayo ka nang patalikod sa pugon.

618
00:36:00,250 --> 00:36:03,000
Iwan mong nakabukas nang kalahati.

619
00:36:03,666 --> 00:36:07,540
Tapos, magtanong ka sa Bannik,
kahit anong gusto mong itanong,

620
00:36:07,541 --> 00:36:13,082
pero ang Bannik,
hindi ka sasagutin nang direkta no'n.

621
00:36:13,083 --> 00:36:15,708
Hindi siya nakakapagsalita.
Hawak lang ang kaya niya.

622
00:36:16,541 --> 00:36:18,124
Kung maganda ang pangitain,

623
00:36:18,125 --> 00:36:21,916
tatapikin ka niya sa likod mo.

624
00:36:22,583 --> 00:36:24,416
Pero kung masama,

625
00:36:24,916 --> 00:36:27,916
kakalmutin ka niya
ng matatalas niyang kuko.

626
00:36:30,500 --> 00:36:32,415
Ano'ng tinanong mo sa kanya?

627
00:36:32,416 --> 00:36:37,582
Tinanong ko siya
tungkol sa Mafia boss, si Marco Moretti,

628
00:36:37,583 --> 00:36:39,749
at 'yong tungkol sa painting.

629
00:36:39,750 --> 00:36:43,416
Sige. At ano'ng sinagot ng Bannik, Bobby?

630
00:36:45,541 --> 00:36:48,500
Bibilhin ko ba ang Botticelli
para kay Marco Moretti?

631
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:58,750
Hinimas ng Bannik ang likod ko
nang napakasarap.

632
00:37:00,083 --> 00:37:02,707
Kaya dapat mong bilhin 'yong painting.

633
00:37:02,708 --> 00:37:04,082
Ang iniisip ko lang,

634
00:37:04,083 --> 00:37:08,332
kahit maganda ang naging simula
ng pagpasok natin sa Italy,

635
00:37:08,333 --> 00:37:11,083
si Cico, pabaya pa rin at di maaasahan.

636
00:37:11,708 --> 00:37:15,082
Pero kung maaayos niya
'yong problema kay Moretti,

637
00:37:15,083 --> 00:37:16,999
nagagawa niya ang trabaho niya.

638
00:37:17,000 --> 00:37:19,416
Bilhin mo ang lintik na painting na 'yon!

639
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:22,750
Nagparamdam na ang Bannik, maliwanag?

640
00:37:24,208 --> 00:37:26,624
- Maliwanag.
- Sige.

641
00:37:26,625 --> 00:37:28,291
Magkape muna tayo.

642
00:37:35,500 --> 00:37:36,915
- Georgie?
- Yes, boss?

643
00:37:36,916 --> 00:37:39,540
Gawan mo 'ko ng piccolo espresso
sa Marzocco.

644
00:37:39,541 --> 00:37:40,707
Dalhin mo sa hot room.

645
00:37:40,708 --> 00:37:43,041
- Okay. Ako'ng bahala, boss.
- Salamat.

646
00:37:48,208 --> 00:37:51,124
Alam kong may alinlangan kayo kay Cico,

647
00:37:51,125 --> 00:37:53,041
pero mas kabisado niya ang galawan do'n.

648
00:37:53,666 --> 00:37:55,958
Makipagtulungan kayo sa kanya.

649
00:37:56,541 --> 00:37:58,957
Sige, Pa. No problem.

650
00:37:58,958 --> 00:38:02,207
Kumusta na 'yong planong
makapasok ang Duke sa House of Lords?

651
00:38:02,208 --> 00:38:04,749
Pag okay na 'yong kay Jack
at kay Lord Hawthorne…

652
00:38:04,750 --> 00:38:07,707
Tiwala kaming magagawa namin 'yon.

653
00:38:07,708 --> 00:38:09,290
Kung may kakausapin, siya 'yon.

654
00:38:09,291 --> 00:38:10,500
Mabuti naman.

655
00:38:11,125 --> 00:38:14,249
Dapat makapasok ka do'n.
Hindi maipapasa ang bill na 'yon.

656
00:38:14,250 --> 00:38:16,832
Walang pero‑pero.

657
00:38:16,833 --> 00:38:19,666
Sige na, giniginaw na 'ko dito.

658
00:38:21,208 --> 00:38:24,915
Papasok na 'ko
nang makapag-piccolo espresso na 'ko.

659
00:38:24,916 --> 00:38:27,374
- Balitaan mo 'ko.
- Oo naman.

660
00:38:27,375 --> 00:38:28,625
Love you, iha.

661
00:38:33,791 --> 00:38:35,624
Palala siya nang palala, Susan.

662
00:38:35,625 --> 00:38:38,249
Hindi. Binibiro ka lang niya. Pampasaya.

663
00:38:38,250 --> 00:38:41,415
Nakabase ang desisyon niya
sa payo ng engkanto.

664
00:38:41,416 --> 00:38:43,374
Nagbibiro nga lang 'yon.

665
00:38:43,375 --> 00:38:44,665
Ladies and gentlemen,

666
00:38:44,666 --> 00:38:47,290
welcome sa Beaumont's
para sa auction ngayong araw,

667
00:38:47,291 --> 00:38:50,707
tampok ang pambihirang gawa
ng isang tunay na dalubhasa.

668
00:38:50,708 --> 00:38:53,957
Ang <i>Virgin and Child Enthroned</i>
ni Botticelli.

669
00:38:53,958 --> 00:38:56,624
Kabilang sa mga naunang may-ari,
si Philip II of Spain,

670
00:38:56,625 --> 00:38:58,249
ang Duke of Orleans,

671
00:38:58,250 --> 00:38:59,750
at si Louis XV.

672
00:39:00,541 --> 00:39:02,791
- Susie!
- Anonymous collector ang may-ari nito.

673
00:39:03,750 --> 00:39:05,416
Tagal kitang di nakita, a.

674
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:08,915
Hi, Joseph. Matagal na nga. Ito si Eddie.

675
00:39:08,916 --> 00:39:10,582
- Joe Green.
- Nice to meet you.

676
00:39:10,583 --> 00:39:12,707
- Art world, ha?
- Ngayon, oo.

677
00:39:12,708 --> 00:39:15,582
- Ano'ng ginagawa mo sa <i>Inglaterra?</i>
- Magbebenta ng painting.

678
00:39:15,583 --> 00:39:18,415
- Collector ka pala.
- Madali kasing maglipat ng pera dito.

679
00:39:18,416 --> 00:39:20,915
Doon nagsimula. Ngayon, nagustuhan ko na.

680
00:39:20,916 --> 00:39:23,874
Sana di tayo maglaban para sa Botticelli.

681
00:39:23,875 --> 00:39:25,374
Wag kang mag-alala.

682
00:39:25,375 --> 00:39:27,582
Wala akong hilig sa Early Renaissance.

683
00:39:27,583 --> 00:39:28,958
- Sige.
- Kumusta ang kapatid mo?

684
00:39:29,750 --> 00:39:33,665
- Okay naman. Nasa labas siya. Batiin mo.
- Oo, sige.

685
00:39:33,666 --> 00:39:34,874
E, ang papa mo?

686
00:39:34,875 --> 00:39:38,624
Ten-year sentence. Nakaanim na siya,
pero mukhang makakalabas siya nang maaga.

687
00:39:38,625 --> 00:39:40,457
Tagal naman no'n, juts lang, e.

688
00:39:40,458 --> 00:39:43,290
Di naman juts ang dahilan. Tax retuns.

689
00:39:43,291 --> 00:39:44,582
Do'n sila nadadale, e.

690
00:39:44,583 --> 00:39:46,750
Ikumusta mo 'ko sa kanya, ha?

691
00:39:47,333 --> 00:39:48,500
Number mo, 'yon pa rin?

692
00:39:49,458 --> 00:39:50,915
Tumawag ka para malaman mo.

693
00:39:50,916 --> 00:39:52,333
Sige, tatawag ako.

694
00:39:53,333 --> 00:39:54,583
Sige, aantayin ko.

695
00:39:56,333 --> 00:39:57,416
Edward.

696
00:39:58,916 --> 00:40:01,583
Parang ano, a… Parang may hugot.

697
00:40:02,166 --> 00:40:03,958
- 'Yong ano?
- 'Yon.

698
00:40:04,583 --> 00:40:06,208
Mukhang may past kayo.

699
00:40:06,791 --> 00:40:09,541
- Ayokong pag-usapan 'yan.
- Lalo ko pang gagawin 'yon.

700
00:40:10,083 --> 00:40:12,665
- Ang gandang lalaki niya, ha.
- Tama na.

701
00:40:12,666 --> 00:40:14,624
- Dako ba siya?
- Eddie!

702
00:40:14,625 --> 00:40:16,082
Kung handa na kayo,

703
00:40:16,083 --> 00:40:20,374
sisimulan na natin ang bidding
para sa pambihirang Botticelli

704
00:40:20,375 --> 00:40:21,665
na nasa kaliwa ko,

705
00:40:21,666 --> 00:40:24,000
ang <i>Virgin and Child Enthroned.</i>

706
00:40:25,208 --> 00:40:26,958
Okay, ladies and gentlemen,

707
00:40:27,583 --> 00:40:30,082
magsisimula tayo sa £2 million.

708
00:40:30,083 --> 00:40:32,040
Mukhang type ka niya.

709
00:40:32,041 --> 00:40:33,832
- Two million. Thank you.
- Tama na.

710
00:40:33,833 --> 00:40:35,624
- 2.5 million.
- Sexually.

711
00:40:35,625 --> 00:40:38,457
- Tama na.
- 2.5 million. Thank you.

712
00:40:38,458 --> 00:40:40,207
Three million pounds?

713
00:40:40,208 --> 00:40:42,374
- Tatawag 'yon.
- Tama na sabi, e.

714
00:40:42,375 --> 00:40:44,999
- Okay 'yon. Matagal na rin, e.
- 3.5 million. Thank you.

715
00:40:45,000 --> 00:40:46,790
Okay lang ako, wag mo 'kong isipin.

716
00:40:46,791 --> 00:40:49,332
Para lang kasing
may chemistry kayong dalawa.

717
00:40:49,333 --> 00:40:50,749
Four million. Thank you, sir.

718
00:40:50,750 --> 00:40:52,249
Four million pounds.

719
00:40:52,250 --> 00:40:54,415
- 4.5 million. Thank you, madam.
- Selos ka?

720
00:40:54,416 --> 00:40:56,332
4.5 million. Five million.

721
00:40:56,333 --> 00:40:57,415
Go ka lang, girl.

722
00:40:57,416 --> 00:40:58,665
Five million sa harap.

723
00:40:58,666 --> 00:41:01,374
Yes, madam. Thank you, 5.5 million.

724
00:41:01,375 --> 00:41:02,874
May magtataas pa?

725
00:41:02,875 --> 00:41:05,916
Six million pounds.

726
00:41:06,500 --> 00:41:08,040
Six million.

727
00:41:08,041 --> 00:41:09,415
Umiinit na, Susan.

728
00:41:09,416 --> 00:41:11,582
Alam ko kung ano'ng nangyayari.

729
00:41:11,583 --> 00:41:14,040
<i>Seven million sa 'yo, madam.</i>

730
00:41:14,041 --> 00:41:16,165
Ikaw ang bida dito. Suportado kita.

731
00:41:16,166 --> 00:41:18,207
- Thank you.
- Nine million pounds na.

732
00:41:18,208 --> 00:41:21,332
Sana lang di dahil
sa pagiging competitive mo 'to.

733
00:41:21,333 --> 00:41:23,415
Nine million sa 'yo, madam.

734
00:41:23,416 --> 00:41:24,458
- Ten million.
- Punyeta!

735
00:41:25,208 --> 00:41:27,499
<i>Ten million. Yes, madam. Ten.</i>

736
00:41:27,500 --> 00:41:30,332
- Nadadala ka lang, Susie.
- Eleven million. Thank you.

737
00:41:30,333 --> 00:41:31,875
Hindi ka nakakatulong.

738
00:41:33,041 --> 00:41:34,458
<i>Eleven million na ang bid.</i>

739
00:41:36,958 --> 00:41:40,499
Twelve million. Thank you.
Nasa 12 million na.

740
00:41:40,500 --> 00:41:42,624
<i>Nasa 12 million na.</i>

741
00:41:42,625 --> 00:41:44,207
May 13 ba d'yan?

742
00:41:44,208 --> 00:41:46,082
Thirteen million. Thank you.

743
00:41:46,083 --> 00:41:48,083
Thirteen million laban sa 'yo, sir.

744
00:41:49,250 --> 00:41:50,957
- Eto na.
- Thirteen million ang bid.

745
00:41:50,958 --> 00:41:52,832
Thirteen kay madam. Merong 14 d'yan?

746
00:41:52,833 --> 00:41:54,750
Pa, nasa 13 na.

747
00:41:55,458 --> 00:41:57,290
Bilhin mo ang painting.

748
00:41:57,291 --> 00:41:59,040
<i>Kailangan natin ang mga Italyano.</i>

749
00:41:59,041 --> 00:42:01,665
<i>Kung masterpiece ang gusto nila,
bilhin mo.</i>

750
00:42:01,666 --> 00:42:03,665
Fourteen million pounds? Fourteen million.

751
00:42:03,666 --> 00:42:05,040
<i>Six million lang dapat, e.</i>

752
00:42:05,041 --> 00:42:07,458
Ewan ko ba
kung ba't pinag-uusapan pa natin 'to.

753
00:42:08,291 --> 00:42:09,415
<i>Sabi ng Bannik, bilhin.</i>

754
00:42:09,416 --> 00:42:11,415
- Pambihira!
- Pa, nasa 14 na.

755
00:42:11,416 --> 00:42:13,165
- Susie.
<i>- Gusto kong mag-relax.</i>

756
00:42:13,166 --> 00:42:14,707
<i>Ngayon, nase-stress na 'ko.</i>

757
00:42:14,708 --> 00:42:16,415
Bilhin mo ang punyetang painting!

758
00:42:16,416 --> 00:42:17,333
Nasa 14 million na.

759
00:42:18,166 --> 00:42:19,082
Mga de puta!

760
00:42:19,083 --> 00:42:21,124
- Akala ko six million lang.
- Bibilhin natin.

761
00:42:21,125 --> 00:42:22,874
Fifteen million. Thank you.

762
00:42:22,875 --> 00:42:25,624
- Fifteen million. Meron pa bang—
- 15.5.

763
00:42:25,625 --> 00:42:27,874
- 15.5 million. Thank you, sir.
- Susie.

764
00:42:27,875 --> 00:42:29,624
Wag kang kakagat.

765
00:42:29,625 --> 00:42:30,874
<i>Sa 'yo.</i>

766
00:42:30,875 --> 00:42:32,708
- Meron bang 16 d'yan?
- Susan.

767
00:42:34,666 --> 00:42:36,249
Going once.

768
00:42:36,250 --> 00:42:38,291
Going twice.

769
00:42:39,458 --> 00:42:40,333
Susan.

770
00:42:41,291 --> 00:42:45,125
Sixteen million pounds para sa Botticelli.

771
00:42:45,625 --> 00:42:46,750
16.5, sir?

772
00:42:47,333 --> 00:42:50,416
Huling bid na. Sa £16 million.

773
00:42:51,916 --> 00:42:55,041
Sixteen million, sold kay madam.
Thank you very much.

774
00:42:55,875 --> 00:42:57,291
Nakakagulat 'yon, a.

775
00:42:58,000 --> 00:43:01,250
Alam kong mabigat, pero puwede ba,
wag ka munang kupal ngayon.

776
00:43:07,500 --> 00:43:09,290
Eddie. May good news?

777
00:43:09,291 --> 00:43:12,666
Nakuha namin 'yong painting.
Personal naming ibibigay kay Marco.

778
00:43:13,250 --> 00:43:14,874
Sobrang busy ni Marco.

779
00:43:14,875 --> 00:43:17,250
Para mo na ring sinubukang
makipagkita sa Santo Papa.

780
00:43:18,916 --> 00:43:22,832
Cico, naglabas kami ng £16 million
imbes na six million lang.

781
00:43:22,833 --> 00:43:24,415
I-set mo 'yong meeting.

782
00:43:24,416 --> 00:43:26,415
<i>Okay, sige.</i>

783
00:43:26,416 --> 00:43:28,665
<i>Kakausapin ko siya. Babalikan kita.</i>

784
00:43:28,666 --> 00:43:29,583
Siguraduhin mo.

785
00:43:30,958 --> 00:43:32,541
- Susie!
- Punyeta!

786
00:43:38,875 --> 00:43:40,125
Jack! 'Yong painting!

787
00:43:41,125 --> 00:43:42,250
Tangina!

788
00:43:43,000 --> 00:43:44,540
Jack, sakay na!

789
00:43:44,541 --> 00:43:46,250
- Tangina!
- Sakay!

790
00:43:52,166 --> 00:43:53,083
D'yan ka lang!

791
00:43:54,583 --> 00:43:56,458
Bilis! Tangina!

792
00:43:58,333 --> 00:43:59,416
Earpiece mo, Jack.

793
00:44:04,833 --> 00:44:07,416
Di puwedeng mawala
'yong painting, Geoffrey.

794
00:44:12,250 --> 00:44:14,832
Sa south stairs ka, baka maunahan mo sila.

795
00:44:14,833 --> 00:44:16,041
Buchanan Street.

796
00:44:17,041 --> 00:44:20,458
Papunta sila sa Buchanan Street.
Kumanan ka, baka maharang natin.

797
00:44:28,583 --> 00:44:29,416
D'yan ka lang!

798
00:44:30,666 --> 00:44:32,125
Kaliwa, Eddie.

799
00:44:35,333 --> 00:44:36,583
Tumba na ang isa.

800
00:44:40,208 --> 00:44:42,416
Kaliwa. Daan ka sa Lower Robert Street.

801
00:44:48,416 --> 00:44:49,375
Bilis, Jack.

802
00:44:51,375 --> 00:44:54,583
May shortcut sa kanan.
Baka maharang natin do'n.

803
00:45:01,416 --> 00:45:03,208
Dalawa na, dalawa pa.

804
00:45:10,500 --> 00:45:13,541
Tumba na lahat,
pero di 'yong may dala ng painting!

805
00:45:18,666 --> 00:45:19,916
'Lika, dito ka!

806
00:45:23,416 --> 00:45:25,833
Sampung segundo, sabihin mo kung sino.

807
00:45:26,416 --> 00:45:27,540
O, tapos ano?

808
00:45:27,541 --> 00:45:30,458
Ano'ng gagawin mo?
Subo mo titi ko, kupal na alta.

809
00:45:33,666 --> 00:45:34,666
Tangina mo!

810
00:45:35,333 --> 00:45:38,541
E, kung titi ko ang isubo mo?
Tapang mong kupal ka, a.

811
00:45:39,333 --> 00:45:40,457
Ganito na lang.

812
00:45:40,458 --> 00:45:44,708
Isulat mo na lang dito 'yong pangalan
para wala nang magsusubuan ng titi.

813
00:45:58,291 --> 00:46:00,791
Ang pangit ng sulat mo. Ano ba 'to, P o B?

814
00:46:02,000 --> 00:46:03,582
- B…
- Hula ko…

815
00:46:03,583 --> 00:46:04,791
Robert Brooks?

816
00:46:05,500 --> 00:46:06,457
Ano 'yon?

817
00:46:06,458 --> 00:46:07,790
Kilalang art dealer?

818
00:46:07,791 --> 00:46:09,790
Oo, ako nga 'yon.

819
00:46:09,791 --> 00:46:11,166
Puwede kang makausap?

820
00:46:14,458 --> 00:46:17,415
Alam naming kumuha ka ng mga tambay
para nakawin 'yong painting.

821
00:46:17,416 --> 00:46:19,790
Art dealer ako, di ako masamang tao.

822
00:46:19,791 --> 00:46:21,415
Ang di ko maintindihan,

823
00:46:21,416 --> 00:46:25,166
kung plano mo palang nakawin 'yon,
bakit pinataas mo pa ang presyo?

824
00:46:25,833 --> 00:46:28,124
Maniwala ka, di ko pinataas 'yon.

825
00:46:28,125 --> 00:46:30,000
May nire-represent akong legit na buyer.

826
00:46:32,500 --> 00:46:34,333
- Okay ka lang, sis?
- Jack.

827
00:46:35,083 --> 00:46:36,375
Sino siya?

828
00:46:38,333 --> 00:46:39,541
Sino sabi siya?

829
00:46:48,500 --> 00:46:49,583
Usap tayo?

830
00:46:54,416 --> 00:46:57,124
- Ano'ng ginagawa niya dito?
- Labas ako d'yan.

831
00:46:57,125 --> 00:47:01,040
Ang Duke ang nagpatawag sa kanya.
Di ba sabi mo ayusin ang dapat ayusin?

832
00:47:01,041 --> 00:47:04,082
Ayusin ang dapat ayusin ang gusto ko,
di bugbog-saradong bangkay.

833
00:47:04,083 --> 00:47:06,958
No'ng huling beses
na may sinuntok 'yan sa atay, patay.

834
00:47:07,458 --> 00:47:10,040
Gusto mo,
ipakilala ko siya kay Organ John?

835
00:47:10,041 --> 00:47:11,958
Pinag-uusapan lang namin.

836
00:47:15,250 --> 00:47:16,832
Ipakilala kita kay Organ John?

837
00:47:16,833 --> 00:47:19,625
Malay ko. Sino ba si Organ John?

838
00:47:21,500 --> 00:47:23,582
Si Organ John ay si Organ John.

839
00:47:23,583 --> 00:47:26,457
Third person ang gamit ni John
sa sarili niya.

840
00:47:26,458 --> 00:47:29,832
Ikaw na ang mag-isip
kung ba't Organ John ang tawag sa kanya.

841
00:47:29,833 --> 00:47:32,165
Si John, magaling mag-ayos
ng dapat ayusin.

842
00:47:32,166 --> 00:47:33,458
Sino ba si Organ John?

843
00:47:36,916 --> 00:47:38,499
Dederetsuhin na kita.

844
00:47:38,500 --> 00:47:42,625
Si John, permanent fix siya
sa temporary issue.

845
00:47:44,916 --> 00:47:46,957
Isang tira lang niya, lunod ka.

846
00:47:46,958 --> 00:47:48,332
Pero sa loob.

847
00:47:48,333 --> 00:47:51,833
Kaya may oras pa kami
para malaman ang gusto naming malaman.

848
00:47:52,416 --> 00:47:55,749
Walang gustong makakita
ng taong aalis sa mundong 'to

849
00:47:55,750 --> 00:47:57,000
na wala man lang style.

850
00:48:02,125 --> 00:48:04,041
Tangina!

851
00:48:04,666 --> 00:48:08,583
Hindi naman ako 'yon.
Ginawa ko lang 'yon para sa kaibigan ko.

852
00:48:09,166 --> 00:48:10,833
At sino ang kaibigang 'to?

853
00:48:13,541 --> 00:48:14,916
Ano'ng pangalan niya?

854
00:48:15,583 --> 00:48:17,000
'Yong mapormang Italian.

855
00:48:18,708 --> 00:48:20,125
Si Gino de Bambi.

856
00:48:25,083 --> 00:48:26,915
Naisip ko lang,

857
00:48:26,916 --> 00:48:29,290
di naman siguro si Gino de Bambi 'to, ano?

858
00:48:29,291 --> 00:48:32,375
Oo, siya nga 'yan. Si Gino de Bambi.

859
00:49:22,041 --> 00:49:22,958
Hello?

860
00:49:24,500 --> 00:49:25,790
<i>Buongiorno.</i>

861
00:49:25,791 --> 00:49:27,957
{\an8}Male-late lang ang Padrone
sa meeting n'yo.

862
00:49:27,958 --> 00:49:30,540
{\an8}Gusto ba ninyo ng Campari
o kahit ano muna?

863
00:49:30,541 --> 00:49:32,582
{\an8}Habang naghihintay kayo?

864
00:49:32,583 --> 00:49:34,040
When in Lake Maggiore…

865
00:49:34,041 --> 00:49:35,000
<i>Grazie.</i>

866
00:49:37,333 --> 00:49:38,541
Ang ganda ng view.

867
00:49:40,208 --> 00:49:42,290
Wag mong paghaluin
ang negosyo at personal.

868
00:49:42,291 --> 00:49:45,165
Hindi. Nagagandahan lang ako sa view.

869
00:49:45,166 --> 00:49:48,582
Hindi, ini-imagine mo
na nagbe-breakfast ka dito

870
00:49:48,583 --> 00:49:51,125
pagkatapos ng passionate na gabi
kasama ang Contessa.

871
00:49:51,833 --> 00:49:54,500
Sige nga, ano'ng type mo? Fleur Du Mal?

872
00:49:55,208 --> 00:49:57,416
Terno? Dark red?

873
00:49:57,916 --> 00:49:59,500
O baka cream and white?

874
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:02,374
Mas maganda pa ang naiisip ko.

875
00:50:02,375 --> 00:50:04,750
La Perla. Black. Peignoir.

876
00:50:05,250 --> 00:50:07,708
Classical silk, 'yong manipis.

877
00:50:08,833 --> 00:50:12,749
- Napaka-specific naman, Edward.
- 'Yon ang taste ko, Susan.

878
00:50:12,750 --> 00:50:14,874
At paano mo masa-satisfy
ang taste na 'yan?

879
00:50:14,875 --> 00:50:16,333
Kapitan ako.

880
00:50:17,250 --> 00:50:18,750
Sanay akong mag-utos.

881
00:50:19,833 --> 00:50:23,208
Sigurado akong susundin niya
ang mga utos na 'yon.

882
00:50:26,291 --> 00:50:27,375
Nandito na, Your Grace.

883
00:50:30,083 --> 00:50:30,916
Eddie.

884
00:50:31,708 --> 00:50:33,250
<i>- Buongiorno.
- Buongiorno.</i> Susie.

885
00:50:34,583 --> 00:50:36,708
Pasensiya na kung naghintay kayo.

886
00:50:37,291 --> 00:50:41,208
Pero… inasikaso naman ba kayo
ng mga tao ko?

887
00:50:41,791 --> 00:50:44,082
Oo, inasikaso nila kami. Thank you, Cico.

888
00:50:44,083 --> 00:50:46,166
Nasaan ang maganda mong girlfriend,
si Bella?

889
00:50:47,083 --> 00:50:50,957
Nasa Monte Carlo siya mamaya.
Bukas naman, nasa Paris siya.

890
00:50:50,958 --> 00:50:53,082
Ang hostess na laging wala sa bahay.

891
00:50:53,083 --> 00:50:56,333
At nasaan naman si Mr. Moretti?

892
00:50:57,416 --> 00:51:00,124
Alam mo, Eddie, hindi siya makakarating.

893
00:51:00,125 --> 00:51:02,665
Parang girlfriend ko, busy din siya.

894
00:51:02,666 --> 00:51:05,249
Hindi madali ang ginawa namin.

895
00:51:05,250 --> 00:51:06,915
'Yan ang bunga ng hirap namin.

896
00:51:06,916 --> 00:51:09,958
Sulit ang gastos n'yo.
Magugustuhan ni Marco 'yan.

897
00:51:10,541 --> 00:51:13,790
Kinukuwento lang niya kagabi
na gustong-gusto niya 'yong Botticelli.

898
00:51:13,791 --> 00:51:16,708
Nanghihinayang nga siya
na hindi niya nabili 'yan.

899
00:51:17,458 --> 00:51:21,165
Mabuti naman.
Sayang lang at wala siya dito ngayon.

900
00:51:21,166 --> 00:51:22,000
Oo nga, e.

901
00:51:22,500 --> 00:51:25,375
Pero, Eddie, my friend, ganito na lang.

902
00:51:25,958 --> 00:51:29,790
Kung gusto mo,
iwan mo 'yong painting dito.

903
00:51:29,791 --> 00:51:31,415
Ako na ang mag-aabot sa kanya.

904
00:51:31,416 --> 00:51:33,582
Gusto namin, kami ang mag-aabot.

905
00:51:33,583 --> 00:51:35,458
Sa laki ba naman ng binayad namin.

906
00:51:36,083 --> 00:51:38,000
Busy nga kasi siya.

907
00:51:38,541 --> 00:51:42,249
Alam ko kung paano kausapin
ang taong 'yon,

908
00:51:42,250 --> 00:51:44,540
pumili ng tamang oras.

909
00:51:44,541 --> 00:51:48,083
Bibigay din 'yon
tulad no'ng bumigay at nahati ang Red Sea.

910
00:51:50,041 --> 00:51:52,874
Hindi mo siya inimbita dito,
tama ba, Cico?

911
00:51:52,875 --> 00:51:55,958
O mas gusto mo bang tawaging
Gino de Bambi?

912
00:52:02,333 --> 00:52:05,582
Sandali nga, may problema ba tayo?

913
00:52:05,583 --> 00:52:07,458
Oo, may problema tayo.

914
00:52:08,500 --> 00:52:09,874
Sa 'yo pala 'yong painting.

915
00:52:09,875 --> 00:52:12,582
Alam naming pinataas mo ang presyo.

916
00:52:12,583 --> 00:52:15,374
Tapos kumuha ka ng mga tambay
para nakawin sa 'min 'yon

917
00:52:15,375 --> 00:52:18,165
para di namin maibigay kay Marco mismo.

918
00:52:18,166 --> 00:52:22,624
Ang problema, di rin maaasahan
ang mga tao mo, tulad mo.

919
00:52:22,625 --> 00:52:26,582
Ginawa nila 'yon
dahil gawa-gawa lang pala lahat ng 'to.

920
00:52:26,583 --> 00:52:27,625
So, pa'no?

921
00:52:28,125 --> 00:52:31,166
Ano na ang susunod mong gagawin, Cico?

922
00:52:35,500 --> 00:52:36,375
Sige.

923
00:52:41,875 --> 00:52:44,915
Akala n'yo ba mauutos-utusan n'yo 'ko?

924
00:52:44,916 --> 00:52:46,750
Mga nagbebenta ng halaman?

925
00:52:47,458 --> 00:52:48,790
Gusto n'yo 'kong kalabanin?

926
00:52:48,791 --> 00:52:50,791
Gusto n'yong kalabanin ang Mafia?

927
00:52:51,791 --> 00:52:54,874
Bakit di natin tanungin si Marco
kung ano'ng papel mo sa Mafia?

928
00:52:54,875 --> 00:52:57,583
At paano natin gagawin 'yon, Eddie?

929
00:52:58,875 --> 00:53:01,374
Tanungin natin siya mismo.

930
00:53:01,375 --> 00:53:03,957
Siya na yata 'yon, di ba?

931
00:53:03,958 --> 00:53:05,416
Mukha nga.

932
00:53:07,250 --> 00:53:10,165
Dahil di mo siya tinawagan,
kami na ang tumawag.

933
00:53:10,166 --> 00:53:11,790
At sinabi namin sa kanya.

934
00:53:11,791 --> 00:53:15,458
Tama ka. Excited nga siya sa painting.

935
00:53:16,541 --> 00:53:18,083
Ngayon nga lang daw niya nalaman.

936
00:53:21,666 --> 00:53:22,583
Tangina.

937
00:53:24,125 --> 00:53:25,582
{\an8}Marco, mag-usap muna tayo.

938
00:53:25,583 --> 00:53:27,790
{\an8}Marco, makinig ka sa 'kin.

939
00:53:27,791 --> 00:53:29,041
Sandali.

940
00:53:29,833 --> 00:53:32,499
Tatawagan ulit kita. Sige, bye.

941
00:53:32,500 --> 00:53:35,207
{\an8}Tinatawagan kita, pero…

942
00:53:35,208 --> 00:53:39,749
Tumahimik ka. Tumahimik ka na.
Nag-uusap na ang matatanda.

943
00:53:39,750 --> 00:53:40,875
{\an8}Tumayo ka do'n.

944
00:53:42,791 --> 00:53:44,165
{\an8}Gusto kitang makausap…

945
00:53:44,166 --> 00:53:45,458
Tayo sabi do'n!

946
00:53:48,541 --> 00:53:51,332
Eddie, nice to meet you.
Salamat sa tawag mo.

947
00:53:51,333 --> 00:53:53,374
Pasensiya na kung sa ganito tayo nagkita.

948
00:53:53,375 --> 00:53:57,790
Paano ba natin aayusin ang problemang 'to?

949
00:53:57,791 --> 00:53:58,958
Mr. Moretti.

950
00:53:59,625 --> 00:54:01,915
Bansa mo 'to, ikaw ang masusunod.

951
00:54:01,916 --> 00:54:06,249
Ikaw ang tamang tao para magdesisyon
kung ano ang dapat na mangyari.

952
00:54:06,250 --> 00:54:08,540
{\an8}Ang bait mo naman.

953
00:54:08,541 --> 00:54:10,749
Pero sa karanasan ko,

954
00:54:10,750 --> 00:54:15,000
ang kabaitan,
laging napagkakamalang kahinaan.

955
00:54:17,458 --> 00:54:20,041
Cico, isa kang ahas.

956
00:54:20,625 --> 00:54:23,416
Magandang tingnan. Nakakadiring hawakan.

957
00:54:24,000 --> 00:54:27,416
Masakit sa 'kin 'to
dahil masasaktan ang inaanak ko.

958
00:54:28,041 --> 00:54:31,041
Mukhang hindi mo alam
ang lugar mo sa food chain na 'to.

959
00:54:31,958 --> 00:54:32,833
Kaya…

960
00:54:34,041 --> 00:54:35,375
ipapakita ko sa 'yo.

961
00:54:51,666 --> 00:54:53,665
{\an8}Bubuksan ko na 'yong gate?

962
00:54:53,666 --> 00:54:55,000
{\an8}Wag muna.

963
00:54:56,125 --> 00:54:58,583
Makalat talaga 'yang si Cico.

964
00:54:59,583 --> 00:55:02,040
Ito siguro ang nararapat sa kanya.

965
00:55:02,041 --> 00:55:06,165
Sa susunod, magkakaintindihan na tayo.

966
00:55:06,166 --> 00:55:08,874
- Naiintindihan n'yo naman 'yon, di ba?
- Oo naman.

967
00:55:08,875 --> 00:55:11,332
Itong operasyong itinayo n'yo

968
00:55:11,333 --> 00:55:15,958
sa loob ng lupang pag-aari ng inaanak ko,

969
00:55:16,833 --> 00:55:19,540
kung tama ang pagkakaintindi ko,
may iba pang tulad nito?

970
00:55:19,541 --> 00:55:21,207
Ang totoo n'yan,

971
00:55:21,208 --> 00:55:24,749
gusto naming palawakin pa
ang operasyon dito sa south,

972
00:55:24,750 --> 00:55:26,375
sa tamang panahon,

973
00:55:27,208 --> 00:55:30,166
kasama ang taong maaasahan namin.

974
00:55:31,458 --> 00:55:33,416
Malaki ang matutulong namin sa south.

975
00:55:35,916 --> 00:55:38,790
Five million buwan-buwan
para sa proteksyon at suporta mo?

976
00:55:38,791 --> 00:55:42,583
PROTEKSYON + SUPORTA NI MARCO
£5,000,000

977
00:55:47,750 --> 00:55:48,666
Salamat.

978
00:55:58,083 --> 00:55:59,083
Enzo!

979
00:56:07,250 --> 00:56:08,208
Fifteen.

980
00:56:08,708 --> 00:56:11,000
PROTEKSYON + SUPORTA NI MARCO
£15,000,000

981
00:56:15,416 --> 00:56:16,540
7.5 million.

982
00:56:16,541 --> 00:56:19,625
PROTEKSYON + SUPORTA NI MARCO
£7,500,000

983
00:56:20,583 --> 00:56:21,499
Ten.

984
00:56:21,500 --> 00:56:23,125
PROTEKSYON + SUPORTA NI MARCO
£10,000,000

985
00:56:24,458 --> 00:56:27,375
Mapagkakatiwalaan ba siya?

986
00:56:30,833 --> 00:56:32,583
{\an8}Hindi sa 'kin, hindi rin sa 'yo.

987
00:56:49,250 --> 00:56:50,749
Umaasa ako sa samahan natin.

988
00:56:50,750 --> 00:56:53,500
Mapagkakatiwalaan ba ang Duke?

989
00:56:56,708 --> 00:56:57,541
{\an8}Ako rin.

990
00:57:15,125 --> 00:57:16,165
Enzo!

991
00:57:16,166 --> 00:57:18,583
{\an8}Buksan mo na ang gate.

992
00:57:38,125 --> 00:57:39,083
Sige.

993
01:00:01,916 --> 01:00:05,666
Nagsalin ng Subtitle:
Janice Ruth Geronimo

